<title>FRANCE: Daewoo Securities interested in SMC.</title>
<headline>Daewoo Securities interested in SMC.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daewoo Securities, a unit of South Korea's Daewoo Group, is interested in the sale of bank Societe Marseillaise de Credit (SMC) which is being privatised, a finance ministry spokewoman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;I confirm that they have expressed an interest,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>She refused to give further details.</p>
<p>The government has said previously it aims to sell SMC before the end of the year.</p>
<p>Daewoo said earlier it was considering buying a state-run bank in France which was being privatised.</p>
</text>
